5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is a pleasure to be with you all. I believe we should look at what our past choices actually delivered to guide us with wisdom.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. I am concerned about the human element. I will investigate the current availability of technical staff to ensure a project can be executed.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I suspect the bottleneck may lie in our shared infrastructure. I intend to check the current state of our facilities and their bookings.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,A prudent start. I shall examine the financial ledgers to see how the actual costs of research have shifted relative to the grant size.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I am happy to be here! I want to find out where projects usually run into trouble, so I'll look into the history of schedule overruns.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I shall examine the closeout files of finished awards and the portfolio review of schedule overruns.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I will look into the staffing rolls for technical posts and the minutes on secondments and crew strength.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,I'll check the accreditation and bookings at shared facilities and the incident logs on shared instrumentation.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I will review the travel and bench-fee lines in the ledgers and the national computing agreement and facility day rates.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,I'll go with the portfolio review of schedule overruns and the station records from partner field sites.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
